<title>USA: Greg Manning to buy Latham Co.</title>
<headline>Greg Manning to buy Latham Co.</headline>
<dateline>WEST CALDWELL, N.J. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greg Manning Auctions Inc said on Wednesday that it has signed an agreement letter to acquire Latham Cos Inc, a private company in Scottsdale, Arizona that owns Larry Latham Auctioneers, a major real estate auctioneer.</p>
<p>Under the agreement, Greg Manning will buy Latham Cos for 1,661,874 shares of Greg Manning stock, and Latham Cos will become a Greg Manning subsidiary.</p>
<p>Latham Cos Chief Executive will retain his current position, Greg Manning said.</p>
</text>
